  Each `on_*` attribute takes the name of a LiveView event and requires an `id`.
  The LiveView receives `%{"detail" => ..., "value" => ..., "id" => ...}`.

    * `on_changed_current` - The custom event fired after the current page is changed from `Carbon.pages_select`.
    * `on_page_sizes_select_changed` - The custom event fired after the number of rows per page is changed from `Carbon.page_sizes_select`.
