  component, set `slot="name"` on the child element.

  ## Events

  Each `on_*` attribute takes the name of a LiveView event and requires an `id`.
  The LiveView receives `%{"detail" => ..., "value" => ..., "id" => ...}`.

    * `on_date_picker_changed` - The custom event fired on this element when Flatpickr updates its value.
    * `on_date_picker_flatpickr_error` - The name of the custom event when Flatpickr throws an error.
